--[[
============================================================
                    KJ CHARACTER SYSTEM
============================================================

CLICK KJ
   ↓
KJ selected
   ↓
Notification:
"Character switched to KJ"
   ↓
Local character reload
   ↓
Wait for CharacterAdded
   ↓
KJ setup
   ↓
Spawn animation
   ↓
KJ aura
   ↓
Moves enabled

CONTROLS
1 = Wall Combo
2 = Barrage
3 = Uppercut
4 = Finisher
G = Ultimate
K = Manual KJ toggle

IMPORTANT:
